"relative w-full h-full p-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-8 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"w-32 h-20 bg-border border border-border rounded-sm flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 z-10\\\">\\n                  <div classNa\n\n[Output truncated for length]","msg":"Tool call: createFile"}
